  "sourceTitle": "Pegu Club Cocktail",
  "sourceText": "Pegu Club Cocktail\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 ounces Bombay Dry gin\n1 ounce Cointreau\n3/4 ounce fresh lime juice\n1 dash Angostura bitters\n1 dash orange bitters\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine in a shaker. 2 Shaker, strain and serve up\n\nComments:\n12 Bottle Bar\n\nAlternative recipe from Vintage Cocktails and Forgotten Spirits (good if you don't have Orange Bitters):\n1.5 oz Dry Gin\n0.5 oz Orange Liqueur (Cointreau recommended)\n0.75 oz Lime Juice\n2 Dashes Angostura Bitters",
